0.800216\">1:51:10</span><span> 829. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ phoṭṭhabbadhātu? Phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ phoṭṭhabbadhātu. ^1-829 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6682.187714\">1:51:22</span><span> 830. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na phoṭṭhabbadhātu? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na phoṭṭhabbadhātu. ^1-830</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6703.109641\">1:51:43</span> 831. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na cakkhundriyaṃ? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na cakkhundriyaṃ. ^1-831 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6717.31299\">1:51:57</span> 832. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ cakkhundriyaṃ? Yaṃ cakkhu catunnaṃ mahābhūtānaṃ upādāya pasādo…pe… suñño gāmo peso – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ cakkhundriyaṃ. ^1-832 </p><p>  </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6735.868853\">1:52:15</span> 833. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na cakkhundriyaṃ? Sotāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na cakkhundriyaṃ. ^1-833 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6752.063408\">1:52:32</span> 834. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na sotindriyaṃ…pe… na ghānindriyaṃ…pe… na jivhindriyaṃ…pe… na kāyindriyaṃ? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na kāyindriyaṃ. ^1-834 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6781.565711\">1:53:01</span> 835. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ kāyindriyaṃ? Yo kāyo catunnaṃ mahābhūtānaṃ upādāya pasādo…pe… suñño gāmo peso – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ kāyindriyaṃ. ^1-835 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6799.88837\">1:53:19</span> 836. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na kāyindriyaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… jivhāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na kāyindriyaṃ. ^1-836 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6813.776624\">1:53:33</span> 837. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na itthindriyaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na itthindriyaṃ. ^1-837 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6827.011185\">1:53:47</span> 838. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ itthindriyaṃ? Yaṃ itthiyā itthiliṅgaṃ itthinimittaṃ itthikuttaṃ itthākappo itthattaṃ itthibhāvo – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ itthindriyaṃ. ^1-838 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6843.770614\">1:54:03</span> 839. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na itthindriyaṃ? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na itthindriyaṃ. ^1-839 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6858.043751\">1:54:18</span> 840. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na purisindriyaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na purisindriyaṃ. ^1-840 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6871.424614\">1:54:31</span> 841. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ purisindriyaṃ? Yaṃ purisassa purisaliṅgaṃ purisanimittaṃ purisakuttaṃ purisākappo purisattaṃ purisabhāvo – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ purisindriyaṃ. ^1-841 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6886.965856\">1:54:46</span> 842. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na purisindriyaṃ? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na purisindriyaṃ. ^1-842 </p><p>  </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6902.951898\">1:55:02</span> 843. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na jīvitindriyaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na jīvitindriyaṃ. ^1-843 </p><p>  </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6916.478188\">1:55:16</span> 844. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ jīvitindriyaṃ? Yo tesaṃ rūpīnaṃ dhammānaṃ āyu ṭhiti yapanā yāpanā iriyanā vattanā pālanā jīvitaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ jīvitindriyaṃ. ^1-844 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6935.35603\">1:55:35</span> 845. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na jīvitindriyaṃ? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na jīvitindriyaṃ. ^1-845<br /></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6952.324833\">1:55:52</span><span> 846. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na kāyaviññatti? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na kāyaviññatti. ^1-846</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6967.691395\">1:56:07</span> 847. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ kāyaviññatti? Yā kusalacittassa vā akusalacittassa vā abyākatacittassa vā abhikkamantassa vā paṭikkamantassa vā ālokentassa vā vilokentassa vā samiñjentassa vā pasārentassa vā kāyassa thambhanā santhambhanā santhambhitattaṃ viññatti viññāpanā viññāpitattaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ kāyaviññatti. ^1-847 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7006.205157\">1:56:46</span> 848. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na kāyaviññatti? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na kāyaviññatti. ^1-848 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7021.920752\">1:57:01</span> 849. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na vacīviññatti? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na vacīviññatti. ^1-849</p><p> \n<br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7036.124049\">1:57:16</span>  850. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ vacīviññatti? Yā kusalacittassa vā akusalacittassa vā abyākatacittassa vā vācā girā byappatho udīraṇaṃ dhoso ghosakammaṃ vācā vacībhedo, ayaṃ vuccati vācā. Yā tāya vācāya viññatti viññāpanā viññāpitattaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ vacīviññatti . ^1-850</p><p>  <span>  </span></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7070.005941\">1:57:50</span><span> 851. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na vacīviññatti? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na vacīviññatti. ^1-851</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7083.990928\">1:58:03</span>  852. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na ākāsadhātu? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na ākāsadhātu. ^1-852 </p><p>  </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7099.043458\">1:58:19</span> 853. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ ākāsadhātu? Yo ākāso ākāsagataṃ aghaṃ aghagataṃ vivaro vivaragataṃ asamphuṭṭhaṃ catūhi mahābhūtehi – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ ākāsadhātu. ^1-853 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7119.857998\">1:58:39</span> 854. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na ākāsadhātu? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na ākāsadhātu. ^1-854 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7134.435747\">1:58:54</span> 855. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na āpodhātu? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na āpodhātu. ^1-855 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7149.940676\">1:59:09</span> 856. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ āpodhātu? Yaṃ āpo āpogataṃ sineho sinehagataṃ bandhanattaṃ rūpassa – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ āpodhātu. ^1-856</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7166.54005\">1:59:26</span> 857. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na āpodhātu? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na āpodhātu. ^1-857 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7181.084519\">1:59:41</span> 858. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na lahutā? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na lahutā. ^1-858</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7198.359506\">1:59:58</span><span> 859. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa lahutā? Yā rūpassa lahutā lahupariṇāmatā adandhanatā avitthanatā – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa lahutā. ^1-859 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7214.492981\">2:00:14</span><span> 860. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na lahutā? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na lahutā. ^1-860 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7229.176522\">2:00:29</span><span> 861. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na mudutā? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na mudutā. ^1-861</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7244.547292\">2:00:44</span><span> 862. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa mudutā? Yā rūpassa mudutā maddavatā akakkhaḷatā akathinatā – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa mudutā. ^1-862</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7261.141384\">2:01:01</span><span> 863. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na mudutā? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na mudutā. ^1-863</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7278.413523\">2:01:18</span><span> 864. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na kammaññatā? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na kammaññatā. ^1-864 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7294.800609\">2:01:34</span><span> 865. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa kammaññatā? Yā rūpassa kammaññatā kammaññattaṃ kammaññabhāvo – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa kammaññatā. ^1-865</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7312.676228\">2:01:52</span><span> 866. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na kammaññatā? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na kammaññatā. ^1-866</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7329.809806\">2:02:09</span><span> 867. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na upacayo? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na upacayo. ^1-867</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7346.77731\">2:02:26</span><span> 868. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa upacayo? Yo āyatanānaṃ ācayo, so rūpassa upacayo – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa upacayo. ^1-868 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7362.497643\">2:02:42</span><span> 869. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na upacayo? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na upacayo. ^1-869 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7378.536407\">2:02:58</span><span> 870. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na santati? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na santati. ^1-870</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7394.945597\">2:03:14</span><span> 871. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa santati? Yo rūpassa upacayo, sā rūpassa santati – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa santati. ^1-871 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7410.027848\">2:03:30</span><span> 872. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na santati? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na santati. ^1-872 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7427.30989\">2:03:47</span><span> 873. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na jaratā? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na jaratā. ^1-873</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7443.158114\">2:04:03</span><span> 874. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa jaratā? Yā rūpassa jarā jīraṇatā khaṇḍiccaṃ pāliccaṃ valittacatā āyuno saṃhāni indriyānaṃ paripāko – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa jaratā. ^1-874 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7464.021142\">2:04:24</span><span> 875. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na jaratā? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na jaratā. ^1-875 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7479.309755\">2:04:39</span><span> 876. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na aniccatā? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ rūpassa na aniccatā. ^1-876</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7496.349101\">2:04:56</span><span> 877. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa aniccatā? Yo rūpassa khayo vayo bhedo paribhedo aniccatā antaradhānaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa aniccatā. ^1-877 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7513.699247\">2:05:13</span><span> 878. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na aniccatā? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ rūpassa na aniccatā. ^1-878 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7531.140917\">2:05:31</span><span> 879. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na kabaḷīkāro āhāro? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ ajjhattikaṃ na kabaḷīkāro āhāro . ^1-879</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7547.095\">2:05:47</span><span> 880. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ kabaḷīkāro āhāro? Odano kummāso sattu maccho maṃsaṃ khīraṃ dadhi sappi navanītaṃ telaṃ madhu phāṇitaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ yamhi yamhi janapade tesaṃ tesaṃ sattānaṃ mukhāsiyaṃ dantavikhādanaṃ galajjhoharaṇīyaṃ kucchivitthambhanaṃ yāya ojāya sattā yāpenti – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ kabaḷīkāro āhāro. ^1-880 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7589.787981\">2:06:29</span><span> 881. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na kabaḷīkāro āhāro? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… rūpassa aniccatā – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ bāhiraṃ na kabaḷīkāro āhāro.\nEvaṃ tividhena rūpasaṅgaho. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7614.269372\">2:06:54</span><span> Tikaniddeso. ^1-881 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7618.585718\">2:06:58</span><span> ##### Catukkaṃ ^1-2-3-5-0 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7621.997075\">2:07:01</span><span> 882. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā upādiṇṇaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ, itthindriyaṃ purisindriyaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ ākāsadhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā upādiṇṇaṃ. ^1-882</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7656.935713\">2:07:36</span><span> 883. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā anupādiṇṇaṃ? Saddāyatanaṃ kāyaviññatti vacīviññatti rūpassa lahutā rūpassa mudutā rūpassa kammaññatā rūpassa jaratā rūpassa aniccatā, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ na kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ ākāsadhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā anupādiṇṇaṃ. ^1-883 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7696.931145\">2:08:16</span><span> 884. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā upādiṇṇaṃ? Kammassa katattā phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā upādiṇṇaṃ. ^1-884</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7714.707096\">2:08:34</span><span> 885. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā anupādiṇṇaṃ? Na kammassa katattā phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā anupādiṇṇaṃ. ^1-885</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7731.251287\">2:08:51</span><span> 886. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā upādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ, itthindriyaṃ purisindriyaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ ākāsadhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā upādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ. ^1-886 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7767.219853\">2:09:27</span><span> 887. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā anupādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ? Saddāyatanaṃ kāyaviññatti vacīviññatti rūpassa lahutā rūpassa mudutā rūpassa kammaññatā rūpassa jaratā rūpassa aniccatā, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ na kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ ākāsadhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā anupādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ. ^1-887</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7812.395455\">2:10:12</span> 888. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā upādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ? Kammassa katattā phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā upādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ. ^1-888 </p><p><br /></p><p> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7831.267482\">2:10:31</span> 889. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā anupādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ? Na kammassa katattā phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā anupādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ. ^1-889 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7847.503148\">2:10:47</span> 890. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā sappaṭighaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… rasāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā sappaṭighaṃ. ^1-890 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7862.679305\">2:11:02</span> 891. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā appaṭighaṃ? Itthindriyaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā appaṭighaṃ. ^1-891\n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7877.019317\">2:11:17</span><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>892. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā sappaṭighaṃ? Phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā sappaṭighaṃ. ^1-892\n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7887.119068\">2:11:27</span><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>893. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā appaṭighaṃ? Āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā appaṭighaṃ. ^1-893 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7897.9366\">2:11:37</span> 894. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā oḷārikaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… rasāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā oḷārikaṃ. ^1-894 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7913.933465\">2:11:53</span> 895. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā sukhumaṃ itthindriyaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā sukhumaṃ. ^1-895 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7928.162614\">2:12:08</span> 896. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā oḷārikaṃ? Phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā oḷārikaṃ. ^1-896 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7939.363977\">2:12:19</span> 897. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā sukhumaṃ? Āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā sukhumaṃ. ^1-897 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7951.744281\">2:12:31</span><span> 898. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā dūre? Itthindriyaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā dūre. ^1-898 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7965.44926\">2:12:45</span><span> 899. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā santike? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… rasāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā santike. ^1-899 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7978.431436\">2:12:58</span><span> 900. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā dūre? Āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā dūre. ^1-900 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7988.103812\">2:13:08</span><span> 901. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā santike? Phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ no upādā santike. ^1-901 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7999.686748\">2:13:19</span><span> 902. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇaṃ sanidassanaṃ? Kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇaṃ sanidassanaṃ. ^1-902 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8013.689498\">2:13:33</span><span> 903. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇaṃ anidassanaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ, itthindriyaṃ purisindriyaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ kammassa katattā gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ ākāsadhātu āpodhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇaṃ anidassanaṃ. ^1-903 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8052.958822\">2:14:12</span><span> 904. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇaṃ sanidassanaṃ? Na kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇaṃ sanidassanaṃ. ^1-904 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8066.581146\">2:14:26</span><span> 905. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇaṃ anidassanaṃ? Saddāyatanaṃ kāyaviññatti vacīviññatti rūpassa lahutā rūpassa mudutā rūpassa kammaññatā rūpassa jaratā rūpassa aniccatā , yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ na kammassa katattā gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ ākāsadhātu āpodhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇaṃ anidassanaṃ. ^1-905 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8114.802927\">2:15:14</span><span> 906. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇaṃ sappaṭighaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇaṃ sappaṭighaṃ. ^1-906 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8142.170965\">2:15:42</span><span> 907. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇaṃ appaṭighaṃ? Itthindriyaṃ purisindriyaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ kammassa katattā ākāsadhātu āpodhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇaṃ appaṭighaṃ. ^1-907 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8170.957236\">2:16:10</span><span> 908. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇaṃ sappaṭighaṃ? Saddāyatanaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ na kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇaṃ sappaṭighaṃ. ^1-908</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8195.035421\">2:16:35</span><span> 909. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇaṃ appaṭighaṃ? Kāyaviññatti vacīviññatti rūpassa lahutā rūpassa mudutā rūpassa kammaññatā rūpassa jaratā rūpassa aniccatā, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ na kammassa katattā ākāsadhātu āpodhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūp