aṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ na kammassa katattā ākāsadhātu āpodhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ sukhumaṃ. ^1-937 </p><p><br /></p><p> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9089.948885\">2:31:29</span> 938. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ dūre? Itthindriyaṃ purisindriyaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ kammassa katattā ākāsadhātu āpodhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ dūre. ^1-938 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9121.991609\">2:32:01</span> 939. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ santike cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ santike. ^1-939 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9153.130849\">2:32:33</span> 940. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ dūre? Kāyaviññatti vacīviññatti rūpassa lahutā rūpassa mudutā rūpassa kammaññatā rūpassa jaratā rūpassa aniccatā, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ na kammassa katattā ākāsadhātu āpodhātu rūpassa upacayo rūpassa santati kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ dūre. ^1-940 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9196.236549\">2:33:16</span> 941. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ santike? Saddāyatanaṃ, yaṃ vā panaññampi atthi rūpaṃ na kammassa katattā rūpāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anupādiṇṇupādāniyaṃ santike. ^1-941 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9222.181599\">2:33:42</span> 942. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sappaṭighaṃ indriyaṃ? Cakkhundriyaṃ…pe… kāyindriyaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sappaṭighaṃ indriyaṃ. ^1-942 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9236.072382\">2:33:56</span> 943. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sappaṭighaṃ na indriyaṃ? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sappaṭighaṃ na indriyaṃ. ^1-943 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9250.212383\">2:34:10</span> 944. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ appaṭighaṃ indriyaṃ? Itthindriyaṃ purisindriyaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ appaṭighaṃ indriyaṃ. ^1-944 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9262.527213\">2:34:22</span> 945. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ appaṭighaṃ na indriyaṃ? Kāyaviññatti vacīviññatti…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ appaṭighaṃ na indriyaṃ. ^1-945 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9279.254888\">2:34:39</span> 946. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sappaṭighaṃ mahābhūtaṃ? Phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sappaṭighaṃ mahābhūtaṃ. ^1-946 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9289.49327\">2:34:49</span> 947. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sappaṭighaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… rasāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sappaṭighaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ. ^1-947</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9304.446095\">2:35:04</span> 948. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ appaṭighaṃ mahābhūtaṃ? Āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ appaṭighaṃ mahābhūtaṃ. ^1-948 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9315.475326\">2:35:15</span> 949. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ appaṭighaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ? Itthindriyaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ appaṭighaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ. ^1-949 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9330.832095\">2:35:30</span> 950. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ indriyaṃ oḷārikaṃ? Cakkhundriyaṃ…pe… kāyindriyaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ indriyaṃ oḷārikaṃ. ^1-950 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9345.92858\">2:35:45</span> 951. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ indriyaṃ sukhumaṃ? Itthindriyaṃ purisindriyaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ indriyaṃ sukhumaṃ. ^1-951 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9357.685428\">2:35:57</span> 952. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ oḷārikaṃ? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ oḷārikaṃ. ^1-952</p><p> \n<br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9372.680066\">2:36:12</span> 953. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ sukhumaṃ? Kāyaviññatti vacīviññatti…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ sukhumaṃ. ^1-953</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9387.000163\">2:36:27</span> 954. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ indriyaṃ dūre? Itthindriyaṃ purisindriyaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ indriyaṃ dūre. ^1-954</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9398.941379\">2:36:38</span> 955. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ indriyaṃ santike? Cakkhundriyaṃ…pe… kāyindriyaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ indriyaṃ santike. ^1-955 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9411.750354\">2:36:51</span> 956. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ dūre? Kāyaviññatti vacīviññatti…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ dūre. ^1-956 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9429.146105\">2:37:09</span> 957. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ santike? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ santike. ^1-957 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9442.018142\">2:37:22</span> 958. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ mahābhūtaṃ oḷārikaṃ? Phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ mahābhūtaṃ oḷārikaṃ. ^1-958 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9452.917289\">2:37:32</span> 959. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ mahābhūtaṃ sukhumaṃ? Āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ mahābhūtaṃ sukhumaṃ. ^1-959 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9462.472164\">2:37:42</span> 960. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ oḷārikaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… rasāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ oḷārikaṃ. ^1-960 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9478.258088\">2:37:58</span> 961. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ sukhumaṃ? Itthindriyaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ sukhumaṃ. ^1-961 '</p><p><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9495.257627\">2:38:15</span> 962. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ mahābhūtaṃ dūre? Āpodhātu – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ mahābhūtaṃ dūre. ^1-962 </p><p>  </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9505.72307\">2:38:25</span> 963. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ mahābhūtaṃ santike? Phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ mahābhūtaṃ santike. ^1-963 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9515.907715\">2:38:35</span> 964. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ dūre? Itthindriyaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ dūre. ^1-964 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9530.391241\">2:38:50</span> 965. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ santike? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… rasāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na mahābhūtaṃ santike. ^1-965 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9546.139953\">2:39:06</span> 966. Rūpāyatanaṃ diṭṭhaṃ, saddāyatanaṃ sutaṃ, gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ mutaṃ, sabbaṃ rūpaṃ manasā viññātaṃ rūpaṃ.\nEvaṃ catubbidhena rūpasaṅgaho. </p><p><br /></p><p><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9567.13624\">2:39:27</span> Catukkaṃ. ^1-966\n<br />##### Pañcakaṃ ^1-2-3-6-0 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9570.449996\">2:39:30</span> 967. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ pathavīdhātu? Yaṃ kakkhaḷaṃ kharagataṃ [kharigataṃ (ka.)] kakkhaḷattaṃ kakkhaḷabhāvo ajjhattaṃ vā bahiddhā vā upādiṇṇaṃ vā anupādiṇṇaṃ vā – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ pathavīdhātu. ^1-967 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9591.835254\">2:39:51</span> 968. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ āpodhātu? Yaṃ āpo āpogataṃ sineho sinehagataṃ bandhanattaṃ rūpassa ajjhattaṃ vā bahiddhā vā upādiṇṇaṃ vā anupādiṇṇaṃ vā – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ āpodhātu. ^1-968 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9616.391581\">2:40:16</span> 969. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ tejodhātu? Yaṃ tejo tejogataṃ usmā usmāgataṃ usumaṃ usumagataṃ ajjhattaṃ vā bahiddhā vā upādiṇṇaṃ vā anupādiṇṇaṃ vā – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ tejodhātu. ^1-969 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9637.48976\">2:40:37</span> 970. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ vāyodhātu? Yaṃ vāyo vāyogataṃ thambhitattaṃ rūpassa ajjhattaṃ vā bahiddhā vā upādiṇṇaṃ vā anupādiṇṇaṃ vā – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ vāyodhātu. ^1-970 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9654.87787\">2:40:54</span> 971. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā? Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ upādā.\nEvaṃ pañcavidhena rūpasaṅgaho. </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9671.467585\">2:41:11</span> Pañcakaṃ. ^1-971 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### Chakkaṃ ^1-2-3-7-0 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9673.916328\">2:41:13</span> 972. Rūpāyatanaṃ cakkhuviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, saddāyatanaṃ sotaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, gandhāyatanaṃ ghānaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, rasāyatanaṃ jivhāviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ kāyaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, sabbaṃ rūpaṃ manoviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ.\nEvaṃ chabbidhena rūpasaṅgaho. </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9702.911183\">2:41:42</span> Chakkaṃ. ^1-972 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### Sattakaṃ ^1-2-3-8-0 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9705.1151\">2:41:45</span> 973. Rūpāyatanaṃ cakkhuviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, saddāyatanaṃ sotaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, gandhāyatanaṃ ghānaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, rasāyatanaṃ jivhāviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ kāyaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, rūpāyatanaṃ saddāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ manodhātuviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, sabbaṃ rūpaṃ manoviññāṇadhātuviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ.\nEvaṃ sattavidhena rūpasaṅgaho.</p><p><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9748.895456\">2:42:28</span> Sattakaṃ. ^1-973 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### Aṭṭhakaṃ ^1-2-3-9-0 </p><p>  </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9751.715411\">2:42:31</span> 974. Rūpāyatanaṃ cakkhuviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, saddāyatanaṃ sotaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, gandhāyatanaṃ ghānaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, rasāyatanaṃ jivhāviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, manāpiyo phoṭṭhabbo sukhasamphasso kāyaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, amanāpiyo phoṭṭhabbo dukkhasamphasso kāyaviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, rūpāyatanaṃ saddāyatanaṃ gandhāyatanaṃ rasāyatanaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ manodhātuviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ, sabbaṃ rūpaṃ manoviññāṇadhātuviññeyyaṃ rūpaṃ.\nEvaṃ aṭṭhavidhena rūpasaṅgaho.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9802.061449\">2:43:22</span> Aṭṭhakaṃ. ^1-974 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### Navakaṃ ^1-2-3-10-0 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9804.976763\">2:43:24</span> 975. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ cakkhundriyaṃ? Yaṃ cakkhu catunnaṃ mahābhūtānaṃ upādāya pasādo…pe… suñño gāmo peso – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ cakkhundriyaṃ . ^1-975 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9821.635636\">2:43:41</span> 976. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sotindriyaṃ…pe… ghānindriyaṃ…pe… jivhindriyaṃ…pe… kāyindriyaṃ …pe… itthindriyaṃ…pe… purisindriyaṃ…pe… jīvitindriyaṃ? Yo tesaṃ rūpīnaṃ dhammānaṃ āyu ṭhiti yapanā yāpanā iriyanā vattanā pālanā jīvitaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ. ^1-976 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9864.235081\">2:44:24</span> 977. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ.\nEvaṃ navavidhena rūpasaṅgaho. </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9879.633921\">2:44:39</span> Navakaṃ. ^1-977 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### Dasakaṃ ^1-2-3-11-0 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9882.536566\">2:44:42</span> 978. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ cakkhundriyaṃ? Yaṃ cakkhu catunnaṃ mahābhūtānaṃ upādāya pasādo…pe… suñño gāmo peso – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ cakkhundriyaṃ. ^1-978 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9901.34485\">2:45:01</span> 979. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sotindriyaṃ…pe… ghānindriyaṃ…pe… jivhindriyaṃ…pe… kāyindriyaṃ…pe… itthindriyaṃ…pe… purisindriyaṃ…pe… jīvitindriyaṃ? Yo tesaṃ rūpīnaṃ dhammānaṃ āyu ṭhiti yapanā yāpanā iriyanā vattanā pālanā jīvitaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ. ^1-979 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9940.64219\">2:45:40</span> 980. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ sappaṭighaṃ? Rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ sappaṭighaṃ. ^1-980 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9954.349186\">2:45:54</span> 981. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ appaṭighaṃ? Kāyaviññatti…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ na indriyaṃ appaṭighaṃ.\nEvaṃ dasavidhena rūpasaṅgaho. </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9972.819149\">2:46:12</span> Dasakaṃ. ^1-981 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### Ekādasakaṃ ^1-2-3-12-0 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9975.130596\">2:46:15</span> 982. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ cakkhāyatanaṃ? Yaṃ cakkhu catunnaṃ mahābhūtānaṃ upādāya pasādo…pe… suñño gāmo peso – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ cakkhāyatanaṃ . ^1-982 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9995.166295\">2:46:35</span> 983. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ sotāyatanaṃ…pe… ghānāyatanaṃ…pe… jivhāyatanaṃ…pe… kāyāyatanaṃ…pe… rūpāyatanaṃ…pe… saddāyatanaṃ…pe… gandhāyatanaṃ…pe… rasāyatanaṃ…pe… phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ? Pathavīdhātu…pe… phoṭṭhabbadhātu pesā – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ. ^1-983 </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10038.546662\">2:47:18</span> 984. Katamaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anidassanaṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammāyatanapariyāpannaṃ? Itthindriyaṃ…pe… kabaḷīkāro āhāro – idaṃ taṃ rūpaṃ anidassanaṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammāyatanapariyāpannaṃ.\nEvaṃ ekādasavidhena rūpasaṅgaho.\nEkādasakaṃ.\nAṭṭhamabhāṇavāro.\nRūpavibhatti.\nRūpakaṇḍaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. ^1-984</p>","media-time":9951.113334}